=C2=BB
parses successfully. It means 'Me, whom the cat sleeps' (whatever the idea
of a sleeped thing is). Second, Lojban doesn't have this notion of 'if this
happens, then that doesn't parse'. If your =C2=ABku=C2=BB hasn't been close=
d, the
=C2=ABle=C2=BB will eat more than you want it to, even at the occasional co=
sts of not
parsing.

~ uakci

